### LLM Output Guardian 接口调用示例（VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client）
@host = http://localhost:8000

### 健康检查
GET {{host}}/health

### ① 完整流水线：Markdown围栏 + 类型转换（业务简写schema）
POST {{host}}/v1/clean
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "raw_text": "好的，结果如下：```json\n{\"gender\":\"女\",\"age\":\"28\",\"risk_level\":\"中\"}\n```",
  "schema": {
    "gender": ["男", "女"],
    "age": "integer",
    "risk_level": ["低", "中", "高"]
  },
  "policy": {
    "unknown_fields": "drop",
    "null_policy": "default"
  }
}

### ② 标准JSON Schema：age 范围约束（负数被判 invalid）
POST {{host}}/v1/clean
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "raw_text": "{\"age\": -5}",
  "schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {"age": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0}},
    "required": ["age"]
  }
}

### ③ 截断修复（流式输出被截断）
POST {{host}}/v1/clean
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "raw_text": "{\"gender\": \"男\", \"age\": 50, \"risk_level\": \"中",
  "schema": {
    "gender": ["男", "女"],
    "age": "integer",
    "risk_level": ["低", "中", "高"]
  }
}

### ④ 仅校验（输入已是JSON值）
POST {{host}}/v1/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {"age": 200},
  "schema": {"properties": {"age": {"maximum": 150}}}
}

### ⑤ 修复但不做schema强校验
POST {{host}}/v1/repair
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "raw_text": "{'a': 1,}",
  "schema": {"a": "integer"}
}

### ⑥ 批量处理
POST {{host}}/v1/clean/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"raw_text": "{\"a\": 1}"},
    {"raw_text": "无JSON内容"}
  ]
}

### ⑦ 按 trace_id 查询溯源记录（从上一次响应中取 trace_id）
GET {{host}}/v1/traces/REPLACE_WITH_TRACE_ID

### 指标
GET {{host}}/metrics
